  <section id="multi-year">
    <h2>Adult-Use Sales, 2020 – H1 2026 — A Five-Year Arc</h2>

    <p>Adult-use (recreational) cannabis sales launched in Maine on October 9, 2020. The first five full calendar years of the program show three distinct phases: <strong>launch ramp</strong> (2021), <strong>double-digit growth</strong> (2022–2024), and <strong>maturation/plateau</strong> (2025). The 2026 half-year data continues the plateau.</p>

    <table class="year-table" aria-label="Maine adult-use cannabis retail sales 2020 to first half 2026">
