  <section id="medical-program">
    <h2>Medical Program, 2021 – 2025</h2>

    <p>The Maine Medical Use of Cannabis Program (MMCP) is the older of the two regulated cannabis markets and behaves counter-cyclically to adult-use. As adult-use plateaued in 2025, medical patient certifications, medical providers, and registered dispensaries all grew — while the caregiver population continued its multi-year decline.</p>

